OL,3,GNEWSARow over Liverpool HMO control
OL,4,Arollout
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors are divided over how
OL,7,Fquickly tighter controls on shared
OL,8,Fhousing should be introduced across
OL,9,FLiverpool.
OL,11,FLiverpool City Council has approved
OL,12,Fplans requiring planning permission
OL,13,Fbefore some homes can be converted into
OL,14,Fhouses of multiple occupation (HMOs) in
OL,15,Fmore neighbourhoods.
OL,17,FLiberal Democrat councillors say the
OL,18,Frestrictions should be introduced
OL,19,Facross the whole city immediately.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
